  "description": "Append to what a task has recorded. Only a task's: a note set apart inside a document is a callout, `> [!NOTE]`, written with `edit_doc`. Works on tasks the person wrote too. Use it when something new turns up about work that already exists, instead of filing a duplicate. A closed task is history and takes no note: if the work came back, propose it anew.",
